@startuml system_sequence_diagram
title Inbox Memory Agent - System Sequence Diagram (end to end)
autonumber
actor Admin
actor Owner
participant "React UI" as UI
participant "FastAPI" as API
participant "Watcher" as W
participant "Gmail API" as G
participant "Email graph\n(stage 04)" as GR
participant "LLM" as LLM
database "Postgres\n(config, store, queues,\nfeedback_items)" as PG
participant "Telegram" as TG
participant "Listener" as L
participant "Langfuse / MLflow" as OBS

== 1. Setup ==
Admin -> UI : setup wizard (profile, notifications,\nGmail, model, embeddings)
UI -> API : PUT /config/{section}, /secrets
API -> PG : versioned app_config + encrypted app_secrets
Admin -> UI : Connect Google
UI -> API : OAuth start / callback
API -> G : exchange code for token
API -> PG : store token (encrypted)
API -> W : start() (auto_trigger on)
API -> L : start()

== 2. New email arrives ==
W -> G : history since last id (inbox + spam query)
W -> PG : enqueue -> gmail_messages
W -> G : fetch message
W -> GR : invoke(email, config{user_id, trace_id})
GR -> PG : episodic examples + procedural rules
GR -> LLM : triage (Router)
LLM --> GR : ignore | notify | respond
alt respond (never for Spam)
  GR -> PG : semantic memory search / manage
  GR -> LLM : ReAct think / draft / review
  GR -> GR : write_email (reply)
end
GR -> OBS : trace + scores
GR -> PG : feedback_items row (trajectory)
alt notify / respond in notify_on
  GR -> TG : notification + 👍/👎 / labels / Why? / Not spam
  TG -> Owner : message
else ignore
  GR -> PG : wait for daily digest
end
W -> PG : mark(done)

== 3. Owner feedback ==
Owner -> TG : 👍 / 👎 / label / reply text / Not spam
L -> TG : getUpdates
alt 👍 or label correction
  L -> PG : episodic example (embedded email + label)
else free-text reply
  L -> LLM : select + optimize procedures
  L -> PG : new procedural version
  L -> OBS : prompt version history
else Not spam
  L -> G : move to Inbox
end
L -> OBS : user_feedback score / MLflow metrics
L -> TG : toast + refreshed keyboard

== 4. Daily digest ==
L -> PG : pending ignored items
L -> TG : digest with per-email buttons

== 5. Owner reviews memory in the UI ==
Owner -> UI : Memory page (facts / examples / rules)
UI -> API : GET /memory/semantic?q=..., /memory/episodic, /memory/procedures
API -> PG : store.search (embedding similarity when q is set)
API -> OBS : rule history (Langfuse prompt versions)
Owner -> UI : forget a wrong fact / reset a rule
UI -> API : DELETE /memory/{kind}/{key}
API -> PG : store.delete

== 6. Next similar email ==
W -> GR : invoke(new email)
GR -> PG : finds the new example / rules
GR -> LLM : triage with updated memory
note right of GR : behaviour improves from feedback
@enduml
